"body": {"content": [{"endIndex": 1, "sectionBreak": {"sectionStyle": {"columnSeparatorStyle": "NONE", "contentDirection": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "sectionType": "CONTINUOUS"}}}, {"endIndex": 166, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 166, "startIndex": 1, "textRun": {"content": "BOOK 2: Quantum Thinking\u000b© 2026 Douglas Schoonover. All Rights Reserved.\u000bPart of The Compendium — Application of Unified Relativity\u000bCore Equation: Ec = Σ wi mi vi^x\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 1}, {"endIndex": 407, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 407, "startIndex": 166, "textRun": {"content": "2. Variable Exponents in Biology\u000b2.1 Why x ≠ 2\u000bEinstein froze the universe with a fixed exponent. Bodies don't freeze. Chronic illness shows x < 2 (energy bleeds slowly), trauma shows x > 2 (energy spikes). Biology needs variable exponents.\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 166}, {"endIndex": 659, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 659, "startIndex": 407, "textRun": {"content": "2.2 Entanglement Coefficients (wi)\u000bWhen external interference hits — bloggers, overseas inputs, corporate access, language injection — wi drops. Low wi = corrupted data. Switching systems (Google → Meta) was strategy to raise wi and restore integrity.\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 407}, {"endIndex": 854, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 854, "startIndex": 659, "textRun": {"content": "2.3 Calculating Cognitive Output\u000bvi is how fast truth moves. Requirement: AI that processes while you type, no tabulating lockout. Real-time velocity matters for clinical and systemic analysis.\u000b\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 659}]},
